    Behaviors:
    - Name: Default
      Description: 'Boss behavior is determined by health remaining. Each amount
        of health removed unlocks a new phase. Each phase adds a new attack to the
        set of available attacks.



        Phase 1 (> 80% health): Chase down target
        and deal melee damage.

        Phase 2 (> 60% health): Charge at target
        dealing massive damage on impact.

        Phase 3 (> 40% health): Fire "trailshot"
        at target.

        Phase 4 (< 40% health): Smash ground spawning minions
        (if configured) and dealing AoE damage.'
